aja con tu infraestructura y requisitos de control.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-81/es/deployment/overview",{"_63":380},"deployment/overview.mdx",{"_38":382,"_45":83,"_59":-7,"_40":383},"es:_7","Kubernetes autogestionado",{"_38":385,"_45":56,"_40":386,"_50":387,"_59":-7,"_12":388,"_61":389},"es:deployment/self-hosted/overview.mdx","Kubernetes self-managed","Elige un flujo de instalación y una arquitectura de red para Lamassu en tu clúster Kubernetes.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-81/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview",{"_63":390},"deployment/self-hosted/overview.mdx",{"_38":392,"_45":56,"_40":393,"_50":394,"_59":-7,"_12":395,"_61":396},"es:deployment/self-hosted/helm.mdx","Instala con Helm","Prepara las dependencias, configura el chart de Lamassu y verifica un despliegue controlado en Kubernetes.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-81/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm",{"_63":397},"deployment/self-hosted/helm.mdx",{"_38":399,"_45":56,"_40":400,"_50":401,"_59":-7,"_12":402,"_61":403},"es:deployment/self-hosted/networking.mdx","Expón el Gateway","Elige cómo llegan los clientes a Lamassu, cuándo definir gateway.addresses y cómo diseñar varios Gateways.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-81/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking",{"_63":404},"deployment/self-hosted/networking.mdx",{"_38":406,"_45":56,"_40":407,"_50":408,"_59":-7,"_12":409,"_61":410},"es:deployment/self-hosted/fastlane.mdx","Fastlane","Arranca un entorno completo de evaluación o laboratorio de Lamassu en un clúster Kubernetes existente.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-81/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane",{"_63":411},"deployment/self-hosted/fastlane.mdx",{"_38":413,"_45":83,"_59":-7,"_40":414},"es:_8","Operación",{"_38":416,"_45":56,"_40":417,"_50":418,"_59":-7,"_12":419,"_61":420},"es:deployment/troubleshooting.mdx","Resolución de problemas de despliegue","Diagnostica acceso, salud de los servicios y dependencias de infraestructura.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-81/es/deployment/troubleshooting",{"_63":421},"deployment/troubleshooting.mdx",{"_38":423,"_45":83,"_59":